Transync Attribution Notice
===========================

Transync packages model artifacts, tokenizer assets, and inference code for
Indic multilingual neural machine translation.

Project name:

    Transync

Default public repository:

    https://github.com/RohanMuralidharan/Transync

This repository preserves the required custom tokenizer behavior: SentencePiece
segmentation must be followed by fairseq dictionary ID lookup. Replacing that
pipeline with a standard MBart or AutoTokenizer path changes token IDs and can
produce invalid translations.

